    {
     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 2. GDP cartogram of North America, United States \
highlighted in orange. Top row: geographic inputs. Bottom row: the resulting \
cartogram. Left column uses only CountryData[\\\"UnitedStates\\\", \
\\\"Polygon\\\"] (mainland 48 states, Alaska and Hawaii missing). Right \
column uses CartogramWL`CountryPolygonRings which splices in the Alaska and \
Hawaii AdministrativeDivision polygons. Every ring of the same country shares \
the country's per-area density, so Alaska and Hawaii grow along with the \
mainland when they are included.\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
       FontSize->10,
       FontSlant->Italic],
      Alignment->Center,
      ImageSize->680]}
   },
   DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}},
